: "Everything the player ran works on the current position or on records. current-position-liberties.js (inspectLiberties) parses the board text and lists chains with their distinct liberties, the region-counting code lists empty regions and their borders, and the rest read game notes, rebuilt the SGF from the move history, and wrote notes. The moves themselves (E5, G3, G7, E3, ...) were passed directly to play, with no loop over candidate moves, no ranking, and no lookahead.", "stop": false}}